<p class="citation">Thomsen, L. (1986). Weak elastic anisotropy. Geophysics 51(10), 1954-1966. <a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="https://doi.org/10.1190/1.1442051">doi:10.1190/1.1442051</a></p>
